  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A custom Gesture Controller does not seem to properly animate if the FX controllers is set to its \"Default\" layer (i.e., didn't click the button). \nI specifically:\n- have an Gesture controller with an additional layer to the base hand layers (named Tail), weighted 1, with an Avatar Mask masking the root \"ButtTail1\" bone.\n- Have a single looping animation, which rotates the ButtTail1 bone back and forth like a sway on the \"Tail\" Layer.\nApplying this layer to my Avatar without changing the FX layer from default does not properly animate the tail. Applying an empty controller to the FX layer causes the tail to properly animate.",
